    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Cast Stormchaser's Talent before playing Mountain from hand. With Mountain played first, they would have 3 mana available and could cast both Stormchaser's Talent (U) AND Accumulate Wisdom (1U), which with 4 Lesson cards in graveyard draws 3 cards instead of 1. By casting before the land drop, they likely miss out on casting both spells this turn, losing massive card advantage.",
